-Obamagate.

00:12:24.075 --> 00:12:25.211
-Obamagate.
-Obamagate.

00:12:25.211 --> 00:12:26.144
-Obamagate.

00:12:26.144 --> 00:12:27.146
-Obamagate.
-Obamagate.

00:12:27.146 --> 00:12:28.013
-Obamagate.

00:12:28.013 --> 00:12:29.448
-Obamagate.
-Obamagate.

00:12:29.448 --> 00:12:31.149
-Stop trying to make
Obamagate happen.

00:12:31.149 --> 00:12:32.384
It's not a thing.

00:12:32.384 --> 00:12:34.419
Just because the president
