take it seriously.

00:12:36.588 --> 00:12:39.859
Every day Trump just tweets the
word "Obamagate" in all caps.

00:12:39.859 --> 00:12:41.326
There's a good chance it's his
twitter password

00:12:41.326 --> 00:12:43.362
