he's already logged in.

00:12:43.362 --> 00:12:45.497
It doesn't even make sense
as a scandal name.

00:12:45.497 --> 00:12:48.033
Obamagate sounds like something
in a sci-fi movie

00:12:48.033 --> 00:12:50.469
